yfinance-ta-patterns (0.3.66-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Release v0.3.66: Comprehensive audit fixes and regressions resolution:
    - Add multi-symbol and single-pattern quantitative backtesting in CLI (_run_backtest_cli).
    - Eliminate 3x redundant backtesting passes in text/markdown mode.
    - Implement strict MCP parameter schema validation (clamp=False by default) preventing masked agent errors.
    - Enforce Yahoo Finance intraday history limits and clamp warmup lookback start date for --date.
    - Support caller-supplied out= buffers in fast_matmul and fast_score_batch SIMD kernels.
    - Handle (K, 1) weights and empty feature batches in pure-Python linear algebra fallback.
    - Resolve precious metals (XAU, XAG, XPT, XPD) to quote fiat currency and handle country assets in calendar.
    - Recognize auto-mode ISO currencies (MXN, NOK, SEK, ZAR) while defending against US stock ticker collisions.
    - Document short series and lookback warmup behavior in talib_compat.py.
    - Add -t alias for --timeframe in CLI parser.

