yfinance-ta-patterns (0.3.65-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Release v0.3.65: Comprehensive audit fixes and regressions resolution:
    - Fix positional CLI symbol duplication in run_cli (parsed.positional_symbols).
    - Return nanogemm to optional extra [gemm] to prevent numpy<2.3 dependency pins and broken downstream environments.
    - Sanitize fast_score_batch input to float32 C-contiguous arrays before dispatching to native NanoGEMM kernels.
    - Restore cdl_hikkakemod warmup scan across bars 7..9 for 100% TA-Lib confirmation parity.
    - Fix FX 4h Friday weekly close candle release timing in closed-only mode.
    - Disallow empty --symbol "" from falling back to all 56 forex pairs.
    - Exclude commodity metal symbols (XAU, XAG, XPT, XPD) from macroeconomic calendar currencies.
    - Cleaned local wheel paths from uv.lock and refreshed dependencies.

